{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otter Yakuza</strong> is a <strong>cozy tactical adventure</strong> where you lead a clan of gangster otters fighting to reclaim their turf from the punk Gekkos of Cobra Corp.  Build your HQ, manage your crew, and wage battle for justice (otter-style).\u00a0It\u2019s strategy, chaos, and family \u2014 mixed with a little fish blood and a lot of honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city forgot who ruled these waters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We didn\u2019t.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INNOVATIVE COSY ADVENTURE TACTICAL STREET WARFARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crate, pole, and vending machine\u2019s a weapon if you\u2019ve got guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the city itself to outsmart enemies \u2014 flip the streets, set up traps, and make every corner your domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175b.poster.avif?t=1768626845\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175b.webm?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175b.mp4?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE-OTTER GANG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zuka leads. Ooki smashes. Haya talks too much. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose two of your otter mates to help Zuka get through each mission \u2014 each brings their own style, their own scars, their own way to handle business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/0f30343e34306318039e48ec81261c57.poster.avif?t=1768626845\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/0f30343e34306318039e48ec81261c57.webm?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/0f30343e34306318039e48ec81261c57.mp4?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD THE HIDEOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your rooftop HQ into a shrine of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Onsen for calm. Tattoo parlour for respect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money laundry machine for\u2026 obvious reasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade means new perks, fresh moves, and warmer fish at dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/2727905e85e6447150771dd64fccd143.poster.avif?t=1768626845\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/2727905e85e6447150771dd64fccd143.webm?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/2727905e85e6447150771dd64fccd143.mp4?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RIVAL GANGS CONFLICTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gekkos run the docks. You run the river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet freaks in spiked jackets, eyeball-lickers, and other cold-blooded pests trying to take your shore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure they regret it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/8859fd0efeda913e6b86e8d82f914500.poster.avif?t=1768626845\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/8859fd0efeda913e6b86e8d82f914500.webm?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/8859fd0efeda913e6b86e8d82f914500.mp4?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY-RICH &amp; FULL OF CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission, dialogue, and upgrade choice shapes your clan\u2019s legacy. Expect betrayal, humor, and family ties in a city that remembers everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR SHORT JOBS OR LONG NIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five minutes or five hours \u2014 every session moves the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No grind, no waiting. Just otters, strategy, and that sweet feeling of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into street skirmishes, return to expand your hideout, or pause the saga mid-stride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a game. <br>This is family. <br>This is business. <br>This is <strong>Otter Yakuza\u00a0</strong>\u2014 the most adorable criminal empire you\u2019ll ever (not) see coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> and join the river\u2019s rebellion.\u00a0Respect earns silence. Disrespect earns visits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The river always remembers.</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711790?t=1768626845","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/7c7530714c3e9354cb9e1ac7b43e7c4c96ebde49/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768626845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/fc46dd4b05e435f19c2f8a485f38c9fe3705f092/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768626845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/fc46dd4b05e435f19c2f8a485f38c9fe3705f092/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768626845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otter Yakuza</strong> is a <strong>cozy tactical adventure</strong> where you lead a clan of gangster otters fighting to reclaim their turf from the punk Gekkos of Cobra Corp.  Build your HQ, manage your crew, and wage battle for justice (otter-style).\u00a0It\u2019s strategy, chaos, and family \u2014 mixed with a little fish blood and a lot of honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city forgot who ruled these waters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We didn\u2019t.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INNOVATIVE COSY ADVENTURE TACTICAL STREET WARFARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crate, pole, and vending machine\u2019s a weapon if you\u2019ve got guts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the city itself to outsmart enemies \u2014 flip the streets, set up traps, and make every corner your domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/98bba6de372a5ad8cdea4f2d37cd175