790/extras/2727905e85e6447150771dd64fccd143.poster.avif?t=1768626845\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/2727905e85e6447150771dd64fccd143.webm?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/2727905e85e6447150771dd64fccd143.mp4?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RIVAL GANGS CONFLICTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gekkos run the docks. You run the river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet freaks in spiked jackets, eyeball-lickers, and other cold-blooded pests trying to take your shore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure they regret it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/8859fd0efeda913e6b86e8d82f914500.poster.avif?t=1768626845\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/8859fd0efeda913e6b86e8d82f914500.webm?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/extras/8859fd0efeda913e6b86e8d82f914500.mp4?t=1768626845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY-RICH &amp; FULL OF CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission, dialogue, and upgrade choice shapes your clan\u2019s legacy. Expect betrayal, humor, and family ties in a city that remembers everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR SHORT JOBS OR LONG NIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five minutes or five hours \u2014 every session moves the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No grind, no waiting. Just otters, strategy, and that sweet feeling of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into street skirmishes, return to expand your hideout, or pause the saga mid-stride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a game. <br>This is family. <br>This is business. <br>This is <strong>Otter Yakuza\u00a0</strong>\u2014 the most adorable criminal empire you\u2019ll ever (not) see coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> and join the river\u2019s rebellion.\u00a0Respect earns silence. Disrespect earns visits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The river always remembers.</strong></i></p>","developers":["GhostBone Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711790/e23a85c624f147d17103324a426ccfa9dfda1b0a/header.jpg?t=1768626845","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>\u00a9 2025 Ghostbone Studio. All rights reserved.</strong><br><br>Otter Yakuza\u2122 and all related characters, environments, names, and visual designs are the property of Ghostbone Studio.<br>Unauthorized reproduction, distribution, or modification of this game or its content is strictly prohibited.<br><br>All other trademarks, service marks, and company names or logos are the property of their respective owners.<br>This game is a work of fiction. Any resemblance to real persons, living or dead, or actual events is purely coincidental.<br><br><i>This game may contain placeholder content or features still under development.<br>Gameplay, visuals, and features are subject to change without notice.</i>","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3711790/189307556/a96acce6ca19fd2515382ccdf18687270f820223/1760543004/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760545125","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_